# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and edit. Per-developer settings.
#
# Name of YOUR local code-signing certificate, so macOS Keychain "Always Allow"
# grants survive rebuilds of ta, ta-daemon and test binaries. Create it once in
# Keychain Access: Certificate Assistant > Create a Certificate, Identity Type
# "Self Signed Root", Certificate Type "Code Signing". See install_local.sh.
#
# Leave unset to use the default name "Trusted Autonomy Local Dev".
# (macOS only today; Linux and Windows have no equivalent yet.)
TA_CODESIGN_IDENTITY="Trusted Autonomy Local Dev"
